  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5605.04 Towing Companies",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5605.04 Towing Companies. Notwithstanding any rule to the contrary, any request for a motor vehicle record for the purposes authorized by RSA 260:14, V(a)(5) shall be made by the owner, officer or director of the towing company.\n\nSource. #7361, EXEMPT, eff 9-1-00; ss by #7621, EXEMPT, eff 1-1-02",
